AiTask qa_r3_e6_slack_no_app {
  label: 'QA R3 E6 Slack channel without the app'
  description: 'QA test 2026-09-24 round 3 (nhi.ty), delete after test: scheduled Slack post to a channel the Holistics app is not in.'

  brief: @md
Using the Ecommerce Official dataset and its Revenue metric, compute total Revenue for August 2026 (by order created date).

